Configuration Options for NLM Phase 6 Integration
==================================================

Phase 6 implements an integrated artificial brain with the following key configuration areas:

## 1. Basic Brain Configuration

```yaml
# Neuron and network configuration
brain:
  neuron_count: 1000          # Total number of neurons
  region_count: 1             # Number of brain regions
  connection_probability: 0.1 # Synapse formation probability

  # Neuron parameters
  neuron:
    v_thresh: -50.0    # Threshold potential (mV)
    v_rest: -70.0       # Resting potential (mV)
    v_reset: -75.0      # Reset potential after spike (mV)
    tau_mem: 20.0       # Membrane time constant (ms)
    tau_ref: 2.0        # Refractory period (ms)

  # Initial conditions
  initial:
    weight_mean: 0.5    # Mean synaptic weight
    weight_std: 0.1     # Weight standard deviation
```

## 2. Plasticity Configuration

```yaml
# Neural plasticity mechanisms
plasticity:
  # STDP (Spike-Timing-Dependent Plasticity)
  stdp:
    enable: true          # Enable STDP
    ltp_weight: 0.01      # Long-term potentiation weight
    ltd_weight: 0.012     # Long-term depression weight
    tau: 20.0             # Time constant (ms)

  # Hebbian learning
  hebbian:
    enable: true
    learning_rate: 0.001

  # Structural plasticity
  structural:
    enable: true
    synaptogenesis_rate: 0.0001  # New synapse formation rate
    pruning_rate: 0.00001       # Synapse elimination rate
```

## 3. Neuromodulation Configuration

```yaml
# Neuromodulators that affect learning and behavior
neuromod:
  # Reward processing
  dopamine:
    scale: 1.0           # Dopamine modulation strength
    plasticity_factor: 1.0 # Effect on plasticity

  # Exploration
  curiosity:
    enable: true
    novelty_threshold: 0.1

  # Novelty detection
  novelty:
    enable: true
    sensitivity: 0.5

  # Prediction errors
  prediction_error:
    enable: true
    learning_rate: 0.1
```

## 4. Memory System Configuration

```yaml
# Memory systems for experience storage
memory:
  # Working memory (short-term)
  working:
    capacity: 100        # Number of active traces
    decay_rate: 0.01     # Trace decay rate

  # Episodic memory (experiences)
  episodic:
    max_episodes: 1000   # Maximum number of episodes
    storage_threshold: 0.5 # When to store episode

  # Associative memory (patterns)
  associative:
    strength_threshold: 0.8
    recall_window: 10    # Time window for recall
```

## 5. Cognitive Systems Configuration

```yaml
# Higher-level cognitive functions
cognition:
  # Attention system
  attention:
    inhibition_strength: 0.5  # Competition strength
    excitation_strength: 1.5
    selection_window: 100    # Selection window (ms)

  # Planning system
  planner:
    planning_depth: 5       # Look-ahead depth
    evaluation_function: "reward_prediction"

  # Self-model
  self_model:
    update_interval: 100    # Body schema update rate
    confidence_threshold: 0.7
```

## 6. Development Configuration

```yaml
# Developmental stages and their effects
development:
  # Stage 1: Critical period
  critical_period:
    stage: 1
    plasticity_multiplier: 2.0  # High learning rate
    synaptogenesis_boost: 1.5

  # Stage 2: Maturation
  maturation:
    stage: 2
    plasticity_multiplier: 1.0
    specialization_factor: 0.8

  # Stage 3: Adult
  adult:
    stage: 3
    plasticity_multiplier: 0.5  # Reduced learning
    stability_factor: 0.9
```

## 7. Performance Configuration

```yaml
# Performance and optimization settings
performance:
  # Checkpointing
  checkpoint:
    enable: true
    path: "./checkpoints"  # Default path
    interval: 1000          # Save every N steps
    compression: "balanced"
    max_saves: 100

  # Replay intervals
  replay:
    interval: 100          # Replay every 100 steps
    consolidation_interval: 1000  # Consolidation every 1000s

  # Development timing
  development:
    stage1_duration: 1000  # Critical period (steps)
    stage2_duration: 10000 # Maturation
    stage3_duration: 0     # Adult (indefinite)
```

## 8. Agent-Brain Configuration

```yaml
# Integration between brain and world
agent:
  # Reward processing
  reward:
    scale: 1.0
    delay: 10           # Reward delay (steps)
    prediction_enabled: true

  # Curiosity-driven exploration
  curiosity:
    exploration_rate: 0.3
    novelty_decay: 0.99

  # Structural development
  development:
    enable: true
    age_factor: 0.1     # Effect of age on development
```

## 9. Example Configuration File

```yaml
# Complete example configuration
nlm:
